# Basic Auth users for Traefik: one "<name>:<bcrypt hash>" line per user.
# This example has no users. The repository never holds a real users file.
#
# 1. Make the real file. Git ignores docker/traefik/users.
#      htpasswd -nbB <name> '<password>' > docker/traefik/users
#    Without htpasswd on the host:
#      docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -nbB <name> '<password>' > docker/traefik/users
# 2. Let Traefik (uid 65534) read it:
#      chmod 644 docker/traefik/users
# 3. In .env, set:
#      TRAEFIK_USERS_FILE=./docker/traefik/users
